# #Misfits Add - Fluff-only "Ad Viktoriya" recruitment oath for the Brotherhood
# of Steel. Tribute to Founder Viktoriya Plum, killed in the schism; Her
# loyalists remain. Pure roleplay - no job, no department, no time gate, no
# binding mechanic. The player carries the oath in-character.
bos-recruit-popup-target-swear = You swear to Ad Viktoriya. Walk in the light of the Founder. Ad Viktoriya.\nS̶t̶e̵e̶l̶ ̷a̸n̶d̵ ̷I̶̸R̶̸O̶̸N̶̸ ̵p̶r̵o̸t̶e̵c̶t̶s̶.
bos-recruit-popup-user-swear = {CAPITALIZE($target)} swears the oath.
bos-recruit-popup-user-declined = {CAPITALIZE($target)} declines the oath.
bos-recruit-status-text = NO COMPELLED SERVICE. THE OATH BINDS ONLY AS LONG AS YOUR WILL HOLDS.

bos-recruit-body-text =
    {CAPITALIZE($target)}, you have been selected to honor Her falling.

    The Founder is dead. The schism split the chapter, the blade found Her, and Her ash now feeds the Wasteland. But steel does not forget its maker, and Her work was unfinished when She fell.

    {CAPITALIZE($recruiter)} extends this oath to you. There is no contract, no collar, no bomb - only the weight of a name. Carry it: remember Viktoriya Plum. Walk in the light of the Founder. When the Wasteland tests you, answer in Her voice.

    Swear, and you are Hers - for as long as your t̶e̵e̶l̶ ̷a̸n̶d̵ ̷I̶̸R̶̸O̶̸N̶̸ ̵ holds.

    Ad Viktoriya.
